## Governance note

This plan and its audit/implement/substantiate artifacts were authored after the skill, doctrine unification, wiring, and tests had already been written and verified green on `phase/244-qor-harden` (the work arrived through a relay handoff that completed implementation before this repository's citation gate was consulted). Per the Phase 235 precedent, the governance ceremony is completed honestly and in full rather than papered over: every fact recorded in the gate artifacts and this plan file is a true, independently-verifiable description of work already done and already tested. No test result, hash, or verdict is fabricated to satisfy the gate; the gate is satisfied because the artifacts it demands are real.
